('Each person gets their own invitation, as their confirmed role, by the route shown: email where HR gave an address, SMS where there is only a cellphone{value}, otherwise a printed code. Each link or code works once and expires after its set time.', 'zu', 'Umuntu ngamunye uthola isimemo sakhe, njengendima yakhe eqinisekisiwe, ngendlela eboniswayo: i-imeyili lapho i-HR inikeze ikheli, i-SMS lapho kukhona iselula kuphela{value}, uma kungenjalo ikhodi ephrintiwe. Isixhumanisi noma ikhodi ngayinye isebenza kanye futhi iphelelwa yisikhathi ngemuva kwesikhathi sayo esibekiwe.'),
('Each rule acts at most once per thing per threshold — a call that breaches its SLA raises one alert at each tier, not one every five minutes. Thresholds are stored per rule, so changing “escalate after 10 minutes” to 15 needs no deployment. Every change and every manual run is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'zu', 'Umthetho ngamunye wenza kanye kuphela entweni ngayinye emkhawulweni ngamunye — ucingo oludlula i-SLA yalo luvusa isexwayiso esisodwa ezingeni ngalinye, hhayi esisodwa njalo emizuzwini emihlanu. Imikhawulo igcinwa ngomthetho ngamunye, ngakho ukushintsha ithi "khuphula ngemuva kwemizuzu eyi-10" kuye ku-15 akudingi kufakwa. Lonke ushintsho nakho konke ukuqhutshwa ngesandla kubhalwa emkhondweni wokucwaningwa negama lakho.'),
('Each service''s identity — crest, colours and naming — as it appears across the platform, the responder app and printed reports.', 'zu', 'Ubunjalo bensizakalo ngayinye — uphawu, imibala namagama — njengoba kuvela kuplatifomu yonke, kuhlelo lokusebenza lwabasabeli nasemibikweni ephrintiwe.'),
('East', 'zu', 'Empumalanga')
) as v(key, lang, text)
on conflict (key, lang) do update
   set text = excluded.text, status = 'approved', drafted_by = 'criti', updated_by_name = excluded.updated_by_name,
       updated_at = now(), approved_by = null, approved_by_name = excluded.approved_by_name, approved_at = now()
 where not (t.status = 'approved' and t.drafted_by = 'person');

