('A failed check sends the bodycam for repair. You will need to choose another one, or say why you have none.', 'xh', 'Uvavanyo olungaphumelelanga luthumela ikhamera yomzimba ukuba ilungiswe. Kuya kufuneka ukhethe enye, okanye uxele ukuba kutheni ungenayo.'),
('A failed safety check or damage sends the firearm to the armourer. You will need to select another one.', 'xh', 'Uvavanyo lokhuseleko olungaphumelelanga okanye umonakalo luthumela umpu kumphathi wezixhobo. Kuya kufuneka ukhethe omnye.'),
