('Adds people to the staff register and updates the ones already there, matched by badge number. Nobody gets access: each person is invited afterwards and activates their own account.', 'xh', 'Yongeza abantu kwirejista yabasebenzi kwaye ihlaziye abo sele bekhona, ngokuthelekisa inombolo yebheji. Akukho mntu ufumana ukufikelela: umntu ngamnye uyamenywa emva koko aze avule eyakhe i-akhawunti.'),
('Adds vehicles to the register and updates the ones already there, matched by department and unit number. A vehicle’s status never changes by import: one off the road stays off the road until fleet control returns it.', 'xh', 'Yongeza izithuthi kwirejista kwaye ihlaziye ezo sele zikhona, ngokuthelekisa isebe nenombolo yeyunithi. Imeko yesithuthi ayitshintshi ngokungeniswa: esingekho endleleni sihlala singekho de ulawulo lwezithuthi lusibuyise.'),
