('Each patient and how bad they are', 'xh', 'Isigulana ngasinye nobunzulu baso'),
('Each person gets their own invitation, as their confirmed role, by the route shown: email where HR gave an address, SMS where there is only a cellphone{value}, otherwise a printed code. Each link or code works once and expires after its set time.', 'xh', 'Umntu ngamnye ufumana isimemo sakhe, njengendima yakhe eqinisekisiweyo, ngendlela eboniswayo: i-imeyile apho i-HR inike idilesi, i-SMS apho kukho iselfowuni kuphela{value}, kungenjalo ikhowudi eshicilelweyo. Ikhonkco okanye ikhowudi nganye isebenza kanye kwaye iphelelwa lixesha emva kwexesha layo elimisiweyo.'),
('Each rule acts at most once per thing per threshold — a call that breaches its SLA raises one alert at each tier, not one every five minutes. Thresholds are stored per rule, so changing “escalate after 10 minutes” to 15 needs no deployment. Every change and every manual run is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'xh', 'Umthetho ngamnye wenza kanye kuphela kwinto nganye kumda ngamnye — umnxeba odlula i-SLA yawo uvusa isilumkiso esinye kwinqanaba ngalinye, kungekhona esinye rhoqo ngemizuzu emihlanu. Imida igcinwa ngomthetho ngamnye, ngoko ukutshintsha "nyusa emva kwemizuzu eli-10" ukuya kwi-15 akufuni kufakwa. Lonke utshintsho nako konke ukuqhutywa ngesandla kubhalwa kumkhondo wophicotho negama lakho.'),
('Each service''s identity — crest, colours and naming — as it appears across the platform, the responder app and printed reports.', 'xh', 'Isazisi senkonzo nganye — uphawu, imibala namagama — njengoko sivela kwiqonga lonke, kwi-app yabaphenduli nakwiingxelo ezishicilelweyo.'),
('East', 'xh', 'Mpuma')
