('For a call that will never have a report: a hoax, a duplicate, or the caller cancelled.{value}', 'nso', 'Mogala wo o ka se tsogego o na le pego: maaka, wo o boeleditšwego, goba moletši o khansetše.{value}'),
('For a notice issued in error. It stays on the register, marked cancelled, with your reason. Refund any money first.', 'nso', 'Tsebišo ye e ntšhitšwego ka phošo. E dula go rejisetara, e swailwe e le ye e khansetšwego, le lebaka la gago. Bušetša tšhelete efe goba efe pele.'),
('For a notice written in a notice book. Copy it exactly as written, with the printed notice number. Notices at the roadside are issued on the phone, where the infringer signs.', 'nso', 'Tsebišo ye e ngwadilwego pukung ya ditsebišo. E kopiše ka mo e ngwadilwego ka gona, le nomoro ya tsebišo ye e gatišitšwego. Ditsebišo tša tseleng di ntšhwa mogaleng, moo mophuli a saenago gona.'),
