('I confirm that I have physically inspected the above vehicle and that the information recorded is accurate to the best of my knowledge. Any faults noted must be reported to the immediate supervisor and recorded in the official pocket book.', 'nso', 'Ke netefatša gore ke lekotše sefatanaga se se lego ka godimo ka mmele gomme tshedimošo ye e ngwadilwego e nepagetše go ya ka tsebo ya ka. Diphošo dife goba dife tše di lemogilwego di swanetše go begelwa mohlokomedi wa kgauswi gomme di ngwalwe pukung ya semmušo ya potleng.'),
