('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'tn', 'Khamera nngwe le nngwe ya mmele mo rejisetareng, kwa e bolokwang teng le gore ke mang yo o nang le yone jaanong. Bapodisi ba ntsha e le nngwe ka app kwa tshimologong ya šifiti mme ba e busa pele šifiti e fela.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'tn', 'Phetogo nngwe le nngwe e tlhoka lebaka le {kind} e kwalwa gape. Diphetogo mo SystemAdmin, Admin kgotsa SystemController di tlhoka gape SystemAdmin wa bobedi.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'tn', 'Phetogo nngwe le nngwe, go tswa mo motlhaleng wa tlhatlhobo.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'tn', 'Molato mongwe le mongwe o o tswetsweng: o sekasekilwe morago ga pego ya one, kgotsa o tswetswe kwantle ga yone ke tafole, le gore ke mang le gore ke ka ntlha yang.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'tn', 'Setlhopha sengwe le sengwe se se mo tirong mo {desks} se tlhagisiwa ka popup e e thibelang e e tshwanetseng go amogelwa.'),
