('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'tn', 'Tirelo nngwe le nngwe ya kwa ntle e HikTech e buang le yone — se e se nayang maatla, fa dintlha tsa yone tsa go tsena di le teng, le fa e araba jaanong.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'tn', 'Phasalatso nngwe le nngwe e bontsha bidio ya sekai, e seng khamera ya mmele. E time ka fa tlase ga Admin → Dikgolagano → Hikvision fa serala se golagantswe.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'tn', 'Sethunya sengwe le sengwe mo rejisetareng, kwa se bolokwang teng le gore ke mang yo o nang le sone jaanong. Bapodisi ba ntsha sethunya ka app kwa tshimologong ya šifiti mme ba se busa pele šifiti e fela.'),
('Every form', 'tn', 'Foromo nngwe le nngwe'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'tn', 'Konopo nngwe le nngwe e na le tlwaelo e e babalesegileng le dikgaolo tse di thata; boleng jo bo kwa ntle ga dikgaolo jwa jone bo a kgaolwa, mme go phimola phetolo go boela kwa tlwaelong. Phetogo nngwe le nngwe e kwalwa mo motlhaleng wa tlhatlhobo le leina la gago.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'tn', 'Mogala mongwe le mongwe o o kwadisitsweng mo mafapheng a gago a a bonalang.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'tn', 'Kgato nngwe le nngwe e e botlhokwa, ntšhafatso, go tsenngwa ga bosupi le tiro e e tlhatlhobilweng — go tswa mo mogaleng wa ntlha{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'tn', 'Mojule mongwe le mongwe mo seraleng — se tiro ya gago le dikonopo tsa mokgatlho wa gago di se letlang.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'tn', 'Mokgatlho mongwe le mongwe mo tirisong eno. Data ya mohiri mongwe le mongwe, badirisi, thulaganyo le dikonopo tsa dilo di kgaogantswe mo database — mola wa mohiri mongwe ga o yo mo go yo mongwe, mo sekirining sepe, mo go romeleng kwa ntle gope, mo patlong epe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'tn', 'Pego nngwe le nngwe ya sepodisi. Batla, sefa, romela kwa ntle, kgotsa o bule e le nngwe go e bala yotlhe.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'tn', 'Go tsena mo tirong gongwe le gongwe, go go šwa pele.'),
('Every radio and hard hat, as the person it belongs to.', 'tn', 'Radio nngwe le nngwe le kefa e e thata, jaaka motho yo e leng ya gagwe.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'tn', 'Tiro nngwe le nngwe e e kwadilweng mo molatong: yo o o kwadileng, yo o o kaetseng tsela, yo o tsibogileng, yo o rometseng pego le yo o o tswetseng. Mela ya tlhatlhobo e nnela ruri.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'tn', 'Pego nngwe le nngwe e bapodisi ba e romelang, e kgaogantswe ka mebala go ya ka foromo. Tlhopha kwa o yang teng.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'tn', 'Karolo nngwe le nngwe, go tswa mo ditemogong go fitlha go saena.'),
