('It gets the next SM- number. Service is recorded from the register below.', 'tn', 'E bona nomoro e e latelang ya SM-. Tirelo e kwalwa go tswa mo rejisetareng e e fa tlase.'),
('It gets the next WA- number. Court and expiry as issued.', 'tn', 'E bona nomoro e e latelang ya WA-. Kgotlatshekelo le go fela ga nako jaaka di ntshitswe.'),
('It goes for repair and your supervisor is told.', 'tn', 'E ya go baakangwa mme mookamedi wa gago o a itsisiwe.'),
('It goes to the armourer for repair instead of back into service.', 'tn', 'E ya kwa mmaakanying wa dibetsa go baakangwa go na le go boela tirelong.'),
('It is alleged that…', 'tn', 'Go tlhalosiwa gore…'),
('It is held on this phone and sends automatically, ahead of everything else, the moment you have signal. Do not wait — SMS or call the control room now.', 'tn', 'E bolokilwe mo mogaleng ono mme e romelwa ka boyone, pele ga sengwe le sengwe se sele, ka bonako fa o na le kgolagano. O se ka wa ema — romela SMS kgotsa o leletse phaposi ya taolo jaanong.'),
('It is in the description, and follows your answers until you type.', 'tn', 'E mo tlhalosong, mme e latela dikarabo tsa gago go fitlha o tlanya.'),
('It is waiting for signal and sends automatically.', 'tn', 'E emetse kgolagano mme e tla romelwa ka boyone.'),
('It may belong to another officer, or the link is out of date.', 'tn', 'E ka nna ya mopodisi yo mongwe, kgotsa kgolagano e fetilwe ke nako.'),
('It may have been closed or reassigned, or it is not for your department.', 'tn', 'E ka nna e tswetswe kgotsa e abetswe gape, kgotsa ga se ya lefapha la gago.'),
('It may have been reassigned, or you no longer have access to it.', 'tn', 'E ka nna e abetswe gape, kgotsa ga o sa na phitlhelelo go yone.'),
('It may have been reassigned.', 'tn', 'E ka nna e abetswe gape.'),
('It resolves {incident_number} and becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'tn', 'E rarabolola {incident_number} mme e nna rekoto ya ka metlha — e ka se fetolwe kgotsa ya phimolwa morago.'),
('It resolves {incident_number}.', 'tn', 'E rarabolola {incident_number}.'),
('It sends when you have signal.', 'tn', 'E romelwa fa o na le kgolagano.'),
('It shows on the radio with your name. Every message is kept in the audit trail.', 'tn', 'E bonala mo radiong ka leina la gago. Molaetsa mongwe le mongwe o bolokwa mo rekotong ya tlhatlhobo.'),
('It stays on this phone under your account and sends the next time you sign in with signal.', 'tn', 'E nna mo mogaleng ono ka fa tlase ga akhaonto ya gago mme e romelwa fa o tsena gape o na le kgolagano.'),
('It will go to maintenance, not back into service.', 'tn', 'E tla ya kwa tlhokomelong, e seng go boela tirelong.'),
('Item / drug', 'tn', 'Selo / molemo'),
('Itemised offenses', 'tn', 'Melato e e kwadilweng ka bongwe'),
('Jack', 'tn', 'Jeke'),
('Jan', 'tn', 'Fer'),
('January', 'tn', 'Ferikgong'),
('Jay-walking pedestrian', 'tn', 'Motsamai ka dinao yo o kgabaganyang kwa ntle ga molao'),
('Jewellery', 'tn', 'Dikgabisi'),
('John Doe or ''Driver''', 'tn', 'John Doe kgotsa ''Mokgweetsi'''),
('Join {value}', 'tn', 'Tsena mo {value}'),
('Joining…', 'tn', 'E a tsena…'),
('Judgment (Split-second decision confidence?)', 'tn', 'Katlholo (Boitshepo mo tshwetsong ya motsotsonyana?)'),
('Jul', 'tn', 'Phu'),
('July', 'tn', 'Phukwi'),
('Jump Bag (Fully Stocked)', 'tn', 'Kgetsi ya tshoganyetso (E tletse)'),
('Jump to…', 'tn', 'Tlolela kwa…'),
('Jun', 'tn', 'Ser'),
('Junction type', 'tn', 'Mofuta wa mokgabaganyo'),
('June', 'tn', 'Seetebosigo'),
('KPI Dashboard', 'tn', 'Dashboard ya KPI'),
('KPI rollup', 'tn', 'Kakaretso ya KPI'),
('KPIs ({length})', 'tn', 'Di-KPI ({length})')
) as v(key, lang, text)
on conflict (key, lang) do update
   set text = excluded.text, status = 'approved', drafted_by = 'criti', updated_by_name = excluded.updated_by_name,
       updated_at = now(), approved_by = null, approved_by_name = excluded.approved_by_name, approved_at = now()
 where not (t.status = 'approved' and t.drafted_by = 'person');
commit;

