('Adds bodycams to the register and updates the ones already there, matched by serial number. Who has a bodycam right now never changes by import; that happens only when it is booked out or handed back.', 'ts', 'Yi engetela tikhamera ta miri eka rhijisitara naswona yi pfuxeta leti nga kona, hi ku pimanisa nomboro ya serial. Loyi a nga na khamera ya miri sweswi a nga cinci hi ku nghenisa; sweswo swi humelela ntsena loko yi humesiwa kumbe yi vuyisiwa.'),
('Adds firearms to the register and updates the ones already there, matched by serial number. Who holds a firearm right now never changes by import; that happens only when it is booked out or handed back.', 'ts', 'Yi engetela swibamu eka rhijisitara naswona yi pfuxeta leswi nga kona, hi ku pimanisa nomboro ya serial. Loyi a nga na xibamu sweswi a nga cinci hi ku nghenisa; sweswo swi humelela ntsena loko xi humesiwa kumbe xi vuyisiwa.'),
('Adds people to the staff register and updates the ones already there, matched by badge number. Nobody gets access: each person is invited afterwards and activates their own account.', 'ts', 'Yi engetela vanhu eka rhijisitara ya vatirhi naswona yi pfuxeta lava nga kona, hi ku pimanisa nomboro ya bheji. Ku hava loyi a kumaka mfikelelo: munhu un''wana na un''wana u rhambiwa endzhaku kutani a pfula akhawunti ya yena.'),
('Adds vehicles to the register and updates the ones already there, matched by department and unit number. A vehicle’s status never changes by import: one off the road stays off the road until fleet control returns it.', 'ts', 'Yi engetela mimovha eka rhijisitara naswona yi pfuxeta leyi nga kona, hi ku pimanisa ndzawulo na nomboro ya yuniti. Xiyimo xa movha a xi cinci hi ku nghenisa: lowu nga riki egondzweni wu tshama wu nga ri kona kukondza vulawuri bya mimovha byi wu vuyisa.'),
