('Adds people to the staff register and updates the ones already there, matched by badge number. Nobody gets access: each person is invited afterwards and activates their own account.', 've', 'I engedza vhathu kha redzhisitara ya vhashumi nahone i vusulusa vho no vhaho hone, nga u vhambedza nomboro ya bege. A hu na ane a wana ndiswikelelo: muthu muṅwe na muṅwe u a rambiwa nga murahu a vula akhaunthu yawe.'),
