('For a notice issued in error. It stays on the register, marked cancelled, with your reason. Refund any money first.', 've', 'Kha ndivhadzo yo bviswaho nga vhukhakhi. I dzula kha redzhisiṱara, yo swayiwa sa yo khantselwaho, na tshiitisi tshaṋu. Vhuedzedzani tshelede iṅwe na iṅwe u thoma.'),
('For a notice written in a notice book. Copy it exactly as written, with the printed notice number. Notices at the roadside are issued on the phone, where the infringer signs.', 've', 'Kha ndivhadzo yo ṅwaliwaho kha bugu ya ndivhadzo. I kopeni nga hune ya ṅwaliwa ngaho, na nomboro ya ndivhadzo yo gandiswaho. Ndivhadzo dza kha bada dzi bviswa kha luṱingo, hune mutshinyi a saina hone.'),
