('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'nr', 'Soke isibhamu esesirejistarini, lapho sibulungwa khona nokuthi ngubani onaso nje. Iinkhulu zikhupha isibhamu nge-app ekuthomeni kweshifu bese zisibuyisa ngaphambi kobana ishifu iphele.'),
('Every form', 'nr', 'Woke amafomu'),
